### API Integration

The woreda parameter is sent to the backend in all data-fetching requests, following the same pattern as the existing `region` parameter.

#### ClimateChart Updates

**File: ClimateChart.tsx**

```typescript
// Build request body
const requestBody: ApiRequestBody = { params: { ... } };

if (selectedGeometry) {
  if (selectedGeometry.type === 'custom') {
    requestBody.geometry = selectedGeometry.geometry;
  } else if (selectedGeometry.type === 'woreda') {
    requestBody.params.woreda = selectedGeometry.name;  // NEW
  } else {
    requestBody.params.region = selectedGeometry.name;
  }
}
```

#### RasterOverlay Updates

**File: RasterOverlay.tsx**

Same pattern - adds `woreda` to `params` when a woreda is selected:

```typescript
if (selectedGeometry?.type === 'woreda') {
  requestBody.params.woreda = selectedGeometry.name;
}
```

#### ClimatologyDisplay Updates

**File: ClimatologyDisplay.tsx**

Same pattern for climatology requests:

```typescript
if (selectedGeometry?.type === 'woreda') {
  requestBody.params.woreda = selectedGeometry.name;
}
```

